    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "under the null hypothesis, the test statistic $ T \\sim \\mathrm{N}(\\mu_o, \\sigma_o^2) $, so that $ (T - \\mu_o)/\\sigma_o $ is distributed as a unit normal, implying from Equation A5.1b that",
